# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-80fd89acbaaf6375311f14e594732f1860c2d09b "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The parking rule specifies that spaces twelve through thirty are reserved for members' vehicles [[cite:obs-80fd89acbaaf6375311f14e594732f1860c2d09b "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

There is a time limit of two hours for parking in non-reserved spaces [[cite:obs-80fd89acbaaf6375311f14e594732f1860c2d09b "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].
